{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971040/extras/5e5baa23d9dc4fac4499b4b47c882fd5.avif?t=1762985140\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971040/extras_big/5e5baa23d9dc4fac4499b4b47c882fd5.webp?t=1762985140 width=1560 height=162 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are strange little creatures that hatch from eggs. They come in all sorts of shapes and sizes and some are even rare! They might not be the strongest or the smartest but with your help they could still become legendary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971040/extras/b00f7588d5421ac429930207041a36d5.poster.avif?t=1762985140\" width=1170 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971040/extras/b00f7588d5421ac429930207041a36d5.webm?t=1762985140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971040/extras/b00f7588d5421ac429930207041a36d5.mp4?t=1762985140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971040/extras/01ce2da8ce7be6067a6b82dfebef66fe.avif?t=1762985140\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971040/extras_big/01ce2da8ce7be6067a6b82dfebef66fe.webp?t=1762985140 width=1560 height=132 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of things! You can pick them up and move them around. You can give them items and equipment to use. You can feed them snacks to heal their injuries. You can train them to be a variety of classes like fighter or cleric. You can get them to explore dangerous places to see if they find treasures or snacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971040/extras/e8f0cbf38f26278ce14e6ed8f4e57967.poster.avif?t=1762985140\" width=1170 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971040/extras/e8f0cbf38f26278ce14e6ed8f4e57967.webm?t=1762985140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971040/extras/e8f0cbf38f26278ce14e6ed8f4e57967.mp4?t=1762985140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971040/extras/e8969c5a1b6a17ebdd7bd3198a7c82b2.avif?t=1762985140\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971040/extras_big/e8969c5a1b6a17ebdd7bd3198a7c82b2.webp?t=1762985140 width=1560 height=132 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you finish preparing, your grubkins will battle the enemies of this cursed dungeon. Each fight is physically driven and the forces of combat can drastically change the outcome. Swords clash, spells unleashed, potions consumed\u2026 If at least one grubkin is left standing, there may be hope yet still of reaching the bottom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971040/extras/6312b692dba378757e33b2d929b601b5.poster.avif?t=1762985140\" width=1170 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971040/extras/6312b692dba378757e33b2d929b601b5.webm?t=1762985140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it